<title>USA: Health Fitness names Don Cochran as CFO.</title>
<headline>Health Fitness names Don Cochran as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Fitness Physical Therapy Inc said Thursday it appointed Don Paul Cochran as vice president and chief financial officer. The post had been filled on an interim basis by director Charles Bidwell.</p>
<p>Cochran previously was CFO of Access Management Corp, a Minneapolis company specializing in document processing and imaging.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
